{"4256630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Null Reach", "steam_appid": 4256630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NULL REACH</h2><br>A high-risk action game set in the unmapped reaches of Europe, somewhere that shouldn’t exist.<br><br>Enter the Null Reach to explore abandoned buildings, scavenge dangerous ruins, and fight your way through a dangerous zone filled with threats. Every expedition carries a deadly risk. Everything you carry can be lost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE REACH</h2><br>Null Reach mixes tight, tense interiors with open scavenger areas.<br>• Descend into sealed labyrinths full of locked rooms and threats  <br>• Clear them to unlock larger hunting grounds  <br>• Return to familiar places that never feel completely safe  <br><br>The world changes as areas open up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH HAS CONSEQUENCES</h2><br>Failure is costly.<br>• Dying drops all your loot where you fall  <br>• You get one chance to recover it  <br>• Fail again, and it’s gone forever  <br><br>Every decision matters when everything is on the line.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO EASY ESCAPE</h2><br>There is no instant exit.<br>• You must earn your way out  <br>• You must reach safety on foot  <br>• And you must survive until extraction<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME ABOUT CHOICE</h2><br>Push deeper for more rewards, or turn back while you still can.  <br>Play it safe, or risk everything for one more find.<br>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NULL REACH</h2><br>A high-risk action game set in the unmapped reaches of Europe, somewhere that shouldn’t exist.<br><br>Enter the Null Reach to explore abandoned buildings, scavenge dangerous ruins, and fight your way through a dangerous zone filled with threats. Every expedition carries a deadly risk. Everything you carry can be lost.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE REACH</h2><br>Null Reach mixes tight, tense interiors with open scavenger areas.<br>• Descend into sealed labyrinths full of locked rooms and threats  <br>• Clear them to unlock larger hunting grounds  <br>• Return to familiar places that never feel completely safe  <br><br>The world changes as areas open up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEATH HAS CONSEQUENCES</h2><br>Failure is costly.<br>• Dying drops all your loot where you fall  <br>• You get one chance to recover it  <br>• Fail again, and it’s gone forever  <br><br>Every decision matters when everything is on the line.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO EASY ESCAPE</h2><br>There is no instant exit.<br>• You must earn your way out  <br>• You must reach safety on foot  <br>• And you must survive until extraction<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GAME ABOUT CHOICE</h2><br>Push deeper for more rewards, or turn back while you still can.  <br>Play it safe, or risk everything for one more find.<br>", "short_description": "Dive into the unknown of The Reach in this souls-like extraction shooter. Scavenge, fight, explore through alien-infested sectors and decide how much you’re willing to lose.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256630/f759cd0dfedc41ceefbd66b1c94aa9805c418350/header.jpg?t=1783964971", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256630/bffe17dcc54e38b65297a4cda32aa0f58635b829/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783964971", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4256630/bffe17dcc54e38b65297a4cda32aa0f58635b829/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783964971", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8192 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (